$ soft-foundry ps    (in <scratch>/sess-a)
running: 5 soft-foundry processes
  pid N  ui  port 4877  in ~/dev/soft_foundry  since <time>
  pid N  phase run intake  change checkout-flow  shell claude (session pid N)  in this repository  since <time>
  pid N  phase run intake  change search-index  shell codex (session pid N)  in <scratch>/sess-b  since <time>
  pid N  ui  port 4879  in this repository  since <time>
  pid N  phase run  shell claude  in this repository  since <time>
recorded as started by phase run with no process found: 1
  ! warn change stalled phase intake: started 2026-10-02T03:00:00Z (codex) and never finished; the session may have been interrupted
exit 0

